<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 3.93 percent.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates rise to 3.93 percent.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose to 3.93 percent on Saturday from 3.83 percent on Wednesday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said four banks traded on the market in 12 reported transactions with a total value of 15.54 million dinars ($22 million).</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
</text>
